      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "如果我可以像那樣的話..."
    },
    {
      "author": "nickyeow",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:48",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "你是在跟我開玩笑吧？！"
    },
    {
      "author": "nickyeow",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:49",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "我長大後想當國王。"
    },
    {
      "author": "fucongcong",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:50",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "我好胖哦。"
    },
    {
      "author": "fucongcong",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:51",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.question",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "那又怎樣?"
    },
    {
      "author": "Zifre",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:52",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "我要把他射下來。"
    },
    {
      "author": "fucongcong",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:53",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "那是因為妳是女生。"
    },
    {
      "author": "fucongcong",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:54",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "我会不高兴，但我不会自杀。"
    },
    {
      "author": "fucongcong",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:55",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "以前讀高中的時候﹐我每天早上六點起床。"
    },
    {
      "author": "fucongcong",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:56",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.question",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "你問這個幹什麼?"
    },
    {
      "author": "fucongcong",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:57",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.question",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "你待了多久?"
    },
    {
      "author": "fucongcong",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:58",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "我不知道它是从哪里来的。"
    },
    {
      "author": "fucongcong",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:59",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "這個不重要。"
    },
    {
      "author": "fucongcong",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:60",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.question",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "哪裡有問題?"
    },
    {
      "author": "fucongcong",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:61",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "不要再把我当成“正常”人！"
    },
    {
      "author": "fucongcong",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:62",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "所有被发明的都是真的。"
    },
    {
      "author": "fucongcong",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:63",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "感到惊讶、感到惊奇就是明白的开始。"
    },
    {
      "author": "fucongcong",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:64",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "宇宙毫无疑问是无限的。"
    },
    {
      "author": "fucongcong",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:65",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "要变得完美，她就是少了一个缺点。"
    },
    {
      "author": "Martha",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:66",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "然而，相反的理论往往也是真的。"
    },
    {
      "author": "fucongcong",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:67",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "我们看东西不是看其实质，而是以我们的主观意识看它们的。"
    },
    {
      "author": "fucongcong",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:68",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "世界就是一个疯子的囚笼。"
    },
    {
      "author": "Zifre",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:69",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "我叫Jack。"
    },
    {
      "author": "fucongcong",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:70",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "从来就没有徒劳的爱情。"
    },
    {
      "author": "Martha",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:71",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "生活就是當你忙著進行你的計劃時總有其他的事情發生。"
    },
    {
      "author": "Martha",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:72",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "没有欲望就等于拥有。"
    },
    {
      "author": "nickyeow",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:73",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "聖誕節快樂！"
    },
    {
      "author": "fucongcong",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:74",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "罗马不是一天建成的。"
    },
    {
      "author": "fucongcong",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:75",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "你是从哪个国家来的？"
    },
    {
      "author": "fucongcong",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:7166",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-04",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "我已经看过这部电影了。"
    },
    {
      "author": "9h0ost",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
